    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/event-management/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Event Management is a clean and sleek theme designed for event management agencies and companies. The beautiful layout is perfect for websites related to event planning, corporate event organizers, seminar hosts, business expos, meeting planners, workshops, networking events, award ceremonies, fundraising events, wedding planners, festivals, concerts, conferences, exhibitions, and virtual event management. It’s equally suited for product launches, cultural festivals, sports events, corporate retreats, birthday parties, private functions, and professional event coordination. Built with a popular event calendar and booking plugin, it enables you to manage event schedules, ticket bookings, RSVPs, and attendee registrations with ease. The theme features secure, SEO-friendly, and optimized code to ensure fast load times and high search engine rankings. Its robust Bootstrap framework and responsive design guarantee a flexible and visually appealing layout across all devices. With extensive customization options, interactive sections like Testimonials and Team, integrated CTAs for better conversions, and social media sharing features, the Event Management theme offers a user-friendly, professional, and performance-driven solution for modern event planners and organizers. View full demo here: https://demos.buywptemplates.com/event-management-pro/"
    },
